# Asset slots

Shipped art is `assets/usable/`. Masters live in `assets/src/` and are not embedded.

`sprites.json` name → rect is a lock. Do not change x,y,w,h for an existing name. Do not repack sprites.png or tileset.png. Tile IDs 0–18 are frozen. New tiles get the next id after growing the sheet down in 16px rows of 8.

Stamp only through `go run ./cmd/stamp-asset`. `cmd/genfx` may overwrite boom_* / spark_* pixels in their current rects and must not move those rects.

Never regenerate lot.json to “refresh art.” Tiles draw ground; objects own AABBs. Concrete decals are paint.

If you need a new frame: reserve rect (no overlap) → write master to src/ → stamp → mark locked in assets/LEDGER.md. One subject per file. Nearest, 16px grid, palette in internal/render/palette.go.
